  "broader": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/elec/302",
  "definition": "Application Forms",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-06-06",
  "historyNote": "#10356, INTERIM, eff 6-6-13, EXPIRES: 12-3-13 (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Elec 300); ss by #10420, eff 9-25-13; amd by #10807, eff 4-1-15; amd by #12334, eff 7-22-17 (formerly Elec 301.04) (See Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Elec 300); ss by #12797, eff 6-6-19; renumbered by #13866 (formerly Elec 302.04) (See Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Elec 300)",
